              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆಕ್ರಮಿಸು (ākramisu) is built from Sanskrit ākramaṇa, \"stepping on, an advance\" (CDIAL 1016), from ā- \"towards\" and kram \"to step\", with the Kannada ending -isu that turns a Sanskrit noun into a verb."
