            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೊಲೀಸರನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ ಕಳ್ಳ ಓಡಿಹೋದನು. polīsarannu nōḍi kaḷḷa ōḍihōdanu. Seeing the police, the thief ran away."
