              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಓಡಿಹೋದೆ, ōḍihōde."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಓಡಿ is ಓಡು, to run, as \"having run\"; ಹೋಗು adds \"away\". Run and go make one verb."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
